## 🎯 Success Metrics

Students using this tool should be able to:
- Demonstrate knowledge of recent TMT deals and valuations
- Answer technical questions with confidence
- Structure behavioral responses using the STAR method
- Perform market sizing calculations accurately
- Discuss current market trends and their implications

